---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Sustainability & EUDR Compliance | Demo Coffee Exporters Ltd."
  description="EUDR deforestation compliance, polygon mapping, and smallholder farmer partnership programs operated by Demo Coffee Exporters Ltd."
>
  <!-- Page Header with Background Image -->
  <div 
    class="relative text-white py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-stone-800 bg-cover bg-center"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.78) 0%, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.90) 100%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524350876685-274059332603?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80');"
  >
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-950/80 border border-amber-600/40 text-[10px] text-amber-300 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
          <span>RESPONSIBLE ORIGINATION</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold font-serif tracking-tight leading-tight">
          EUDR Compliance and Smallholder Stewardship
        </h1>
        <p class="text-stone-200 text-sm sm:text-base mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Full supply chain traceability from smallholder farm plots to destination ports. Combining GPS polygon boundary mapping with direct cash premiums for regenerative agroforestry.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EUDR Deforestation Compliance Core Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block">
            REGULATORY READINESS
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Comprehensive European Union Deforestation Regulation Compliance
          </h2>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The EUDR requires European green coffee buyers to verify that imported commodities did not originate on land deforested after December 31, 2020. Demo Coffee Exporters demonstrates field mapping and digital trace architecture to make this compliance effortless for importer partners.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
            <div class="border-l-2 border-coffee-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase">GPS Polygon Mapping</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">
                All production plots over 4 hectares are mapped using six-decimal polygon boundary coordinates. Plots under 4 hectares feature single-point geolocations verified against historical satellite databases.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-l-2 border-coffee-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase">Satellite Forest Cover Audits</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">
                Overlaying farm boundaries against Global Forest Watch imagery confirms zero conversion of primary or protected forests in Mount Elgon and Rwenzori national park buffer zones.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-l-2 border-coffee-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase">Digital Due Diligence Statements (DDS)</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">
                Every bill of lading is paired with an electronic data package ready for instant ingestion by your European customs broker into the European Commission Traces platform.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Compliance Card Box -->
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-stone-200 space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-stone-200">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-stone-500">EU REGULATION 2023/1115</span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">EUDR Readiness Audit</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold">
              100% DEMO AUDITED
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <div>
                <span class="font-bold text-stone-900">Farm Polygons Captured:</span>
                <span class="text-stone-600"> 4,200+ simulated smallholder records on file.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <div>
                <span class="font-bold text-stone-900">Deforestation Cutoff Date:</span>
                <span class="text-stone-600"> Verified deforestation-free post-December 31, 2020.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <div>
                <span class="font-bold text-stone-900">National Legality Compliance:</span>
                <span class="text-stone-600"> Land tenure and labor laws certified under Ugandan statutes.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 text-stone-500 text-xs text-center border-t border-stone-200">
            Simulated data package available for review upon contract booking.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Farmer Welfare & Regenerative Agriculture -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-[#FAF8F5] border-t border-stone-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block mb-2">
          COMMUNITY AND ECOLOGY
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 tracking-tight">
          Regenerative Agroforestry and Fair Farmer Terms
        </h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Long-term coffee availability depends on healthy soil biology and thriving smallholder families. We demonstrate direct farmer support networks in Eastern and Western Uganda.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Direct Farm-Gate Cash Payments</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Smallholders receive prompt mobile money or cash settlements on the day of delivery, eliminating intermediary middlemen and predatory credit cycles.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Indigenous Shade Tree Nurseries</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            We propagate and distribute native canopy tree seedlings (Cordia africana, Albizia) to maintain agroforestry cover, prevent mountain erosion, and foster biodiversity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif text-stone-900">Eco-Pulper Water Recycling</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Washing stations utilize low-water eco-pulpers and sedimentation stabilization ponds, reducing freshwater consumption by over 80 percent compared to legacy channels.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Bar with Background Image -->
  <section 
    class="py-16 text-white relative bg-cover bg-center"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.85), rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.85)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511537190424-bbbab87ac5eb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80');"
  >
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 relative z-10">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white">Source EUDR-Compliant Uganda Coffee</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-300 mt-1">Request technical compliance dossiers and harvest allocations from our trade desk.</p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/quote"
        class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-[#A35326] hover:bg-[#8E431B] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-md"
      >
        Inquire with Sustainability Team
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
